test root_binary_does_not_depend_on_internal_crates_post_extraction ... ignored, Aspirational. The root binary is the assembly point: it constructs SpotifyClient + AnalyticsStore on startup, owns the clap Cli enum (which embeds backend types), and wires the daemon autostart. Even with every business module extracted (which has happened), Cargo.toml lists backend crates as direct deps because the binary's entry path mentions their types. Re-enabling this test would require either type-erasing those entry-time constructions or moving them into wrapper functions inside cli/tui/daemon; both are substantial refactors with limited payoff.
